{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:50:26.431Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"- [x] main (1.21.1): include MC version in jar filename (`siasworkshop-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`) via gradle properties — 61ce56a\n- [x] Create `version/1.20.1` branch from main; switch build to MDG legacy plugin (`net.neoforged.moddev.legacyforge`), JDK 17 toolchain, NeoForge `1.20.1-47.1.106`, Parchment 1.20.1 — 60f038a\n- [x] Port src to 1.20.1 per the delta checklist in the wiki (data components→NBT is the big one; use/MenuScreens/NetworkHooks/ChunkStatus/structure signatures) — done via coder subagent; build+runData green\n- [x] Port/verify resources (pools, tags, processor lists, compass model, lang unchanged; mods.toml converted to FML 47.1 format — modId \"forge\", mandatory=true; loot regenerated under loot_tables/)\n- [x] CI: build both branches (workflow triggers on main + version/*), jar uploaded as artifact — cherry-picked to both branches\n- [ ] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config) — user","oldString":"- [ ] main (1.21.1): include MC version in jar filename (`siasworkshop-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`) via gradle properties\n- [ ] Create `version/1.20.1` branch from main; switch build to MDG legacy plugin (`net.neoforged.moddev.legacyforge`), JDK 17 toolchain, NeoForge `1.20.1-47.1.106`, Parchment 1.20.1\n- [ ] Port src to 1.20.1 per the delta checklist in the wiki (data components→NBT is the big one; use/MenuScreens/NetworkHooks/ChunkStatus/structure signatures)\n- [ ] Port/verify resources (pools, tags, processor lists, compass model, lang; mods.toml dependency ranges for 47.1)\n- [ ] CI: build both branches (workflow matrix or per-branch triggers), tagged releases produce both jars\n- [ ] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config)","path":"mdocs/initiatives/multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1--2026-10-08.md"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:50:26.434Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"## 1.20.1 backport findings (from the actual port, commit 60f038a)\n\n- **MDG legacy plugin**: `legacyForge { enable { neoForgeVersion = \"1.20.1-47.1.106\" } }`. Plain `version = \"...\"` targets **MinecraftForge** (`net.minecraftforge` group); `neoForgeVersion` is what selects the `net.neoforged:forge` artifact. Extension rename `neoForge {}` → `legacyForge {}` includes `legacyForge.ideSyncTask`.\n- **FML 47.1 reads only `META-INF/mods.toml`** — `neoforge.mods.toml` is silently ignored (mod simply doesn't load, no error). Dependency syntax is pre-1.20.2: `mandatory=true` (the 1.21 `type=\"required\"` fails validation with \"Missing required field mandatory\"), and the loader modId is **`forge`** with range like `[47,)` (runtime forge-mod version is `47.1.106`, so `[1.20.1-47.1.106,)` can never match).\n- **FML 47.1 config/entry deltas**: `ModLoadingContext.get().registerConfig(...)` (ModContainer has no `registerConfig`); `@Mod` has only `value()` (no `dist` attribute) — client-only wiring via `@Mod.EventBusSubscriber(modid, bus = Bus.MOD, value = Dist.CLIENT)`; no NeoForge-style `ConfigurationScreen` extension point → no in-game config GUI on 1.20.1 (edit `serverconfig/*.toml` directly).\n- **Forge 47.1 registries**: only `RegistryObject` + plain `DeferredRegister.create(...)` — no `DeferredHolder`/`DeferredBlock`/`DeferredItem`/`Blocks`/`Items` helpers; block items registered manually. `ForgeConfigSpec` (not `ModConfigSpec`); `NetworkHooks.openScreen(player, provider, pos)`; `IForgeMenuType.create(...)` over plain `FriendlyByteBuf` (no `RegistryFriendlyByteBuf`, no `IMenuTypeExtension`); `MenuScreens.register` is public (no event needed).\n- **Good news**: `CompassItemPropertyFunction.CompassTarget` exists in 1.20.1 — the mirror-target away-compass ports as-is (`GlobalPos.of(...)`, private ctor). Structure lookup (`findNearestMapStructure`), `StructureTags.VILLAGE`, `setStartForStructure`, template pools/processor JSON all unchanged.\n- **Structure code deltas**: `Structure.generate(...)` in 1.20.1 takes the `StructureTemplateManager` + `LevelHeightAccessor` (from `ServerLevel.getStructureManager()` / the level) and has no trailing biome predicate the way 21.1 does — re-verify call shape against the 1.20.1 sources. `StructureProcessorType` is `Codec`-based (not `MapCodec`): `type() { return () -> CODEC.codec(); }`.\n- **Datagen on 47.1**: providers live at `net.minecraftforge.client.model.generators.*`/`net.minecraftforge.data.event.GatherDataEvent`; loot outputs to `data/<mod>/loot_tables/blocks/` (plural — 1.21 uses singular `loot_table/`). `BlockEntity` NBT: `saveAdditional(CompoundTag)` / `load(CompoundTag)` — no `HolderLookup.Provider`.\n\n## Referenced By\n\n*Auto-generated by mdocs*","oldString":"## Referenced By\n\n*Auto-generated by mdocs*","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/multi-version-release-notes.md"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:50:26.436Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"- [x] main (1.21.1): include MC version in jar filename (`siasworkshop-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`) via gradle properties — 61ce56a\n- [x] Create `version/1.20.1` branch from main; switch build to MDG legacy plugin (`net.neoforged.moddev.legacyforge`), JDK 17 toolchain, NeoForge `1.20.1-47.1.106`, Parchment 1.20.1 — 60f038a\n- [x] Port src to 1.20.1 per the delta checklist in the wiki (data components→NBT is the big one; use/MenuScreens/NetworkHooks/ChunkStatus/structure signatures) — done via coder subagent; build+runData green\n- [x] Port/verify resources (pools, tags, processor lists, compass model, lang unchanged; mods.toml converted to FML 47.1 format — modId \"forge\", mandatory=true; loot regenerated under loot_tables/)\n- [x] CI: build both branches (workflow triggers on main + version/*), jar uploaded as artifact — cherry-picked to both branches\n- [ ] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config) — user","oldString":"- [ ] main (1.21.1): include MC version in jar filename (`siasworkshop-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`) via gradle properties\n- [ ] Create `version/1.20.1` branch from main; switch build to MDG legacy plugin (`net.neoforged.moddev.legacyforge`), JDK 17 toolchain, NeoForge `1.20.1-47.1.106`, Parchment 1.20.1\n- [ ] Port src to 1.20.1 per the delta checklist in the wiki (data components→NBT is the big one; use/MenuScreens/NetworkHooks/ChunkStatus/structure signatures)\n- [ ] Port/verify resources (pools, tags, processor lists, compass model, lang; mods.toml dependency ranges for 47.1)\n- [ ] CI: build both branches (workflow matrix or per-branch triggers), tagged releases produce both jars\n- [ ] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config)","path":"mdocs/initiatives/multi-version-release-