{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:58:04.566Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"- **Datagen on 47.1**: providers live at `net.minecraftforge.client.model.generators.*`/`net.minecraftforge.data.event.GatherDataEvent`; loot outputs to `data/<mod>/loot_tables/blocks/` (plural — 1.21 uses singular `loot_table/`). `BlockEntity` NBT: `saveAdditional(CompoundTag)` / `load(CompoundTag)` — no `HolderLookup.Provider`.\n- **`pack.mcmeta` is required on 1.20.1** (pack_format 15): without it the dev run shows \"failed to load a valid ResourcePackInfo\" for `build/classes/java/main` and the mod's client resources don't load. The 1.21 template doesn't ship one because 1.20.2+ dropped the requirement — the 1.20.1 branch adds `src/main/resources/pack.mcmeta`.","oldString":"- **Datagen on 47.1**: providers live at `net.minecraftforge.client.model.generators.*`/`net.minecraftforge.data.event.GatherDataEvent`; loot outputs to `data/<mod>/loot_tables/blocks/` (plural — 1.21 uses singular `loot_table/`). `BlockEntity` NBT: `saveAdditional(CompoundTag)` / `load(CompoundTag)` — no `HolderLookup.Provider`.","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/multi-version-release-notes.md"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T19:58:04.566Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1","step":"PLAN","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"- [x] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config) — user confirmed 1.20.1 works 2026-10-08 (after adding the 1.20.1-required pack.mcmeta, pack_format 15)","oldString":"- [ ] Smoke test: runClient + feature checklist on both versions (compass, foundation, cherryfy, config) — user","path":"mdocs/initiatives/multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1--2026-10-08.md"}}}
